        "q2": {
          "type": "qa",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Do you surface and stripe the court too?",
            "answer": "<p>We pour and finish the concrete pad — flat, true and cured correctly, which is what a surfacing system needs underneath it. We'll coordinate timing with your surfacing installer.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q3": {
          "type": "qa",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How flat does a court slab need to be?",
            "answer": "<p>Flatter than a patio. We set forms to a tighter tolerance and finish accordingly, because a dip you'd never notice on a patio is a dead spot on a court.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q4": {
          "type": "qa",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Do you handle the dirt work and demolition?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes — clearing, demolition, excavation, grading and the pour are all one crew. See our <a href=\"/pages/retaining-walls\">retaining walls</a> page if your yard needs a grade change first.</p>"
